flowchart TD
    REC[Remediation Recommendation Card<br/>Action ID, Target Service, Blast Radius, Predicted Delta] --> APP{Operator Approval Gate}

    APP -->|Rejected / Timed Out| CANC[Status: REJECTED / EXPIRED]
    APP -->|Approved by Human Operator| TOK[Generate Approval Token<br/>Operator ID + Nonce + 900s TTL]

    TOK --> POL{15 Safety Policy Gates}

    subgraph Policies["15 Execution Safety Policy Rules"]
        POL --> R1["Rules 1-3: Local Env & Service/Action Allowlists"]
        POL --> R4["Rules 4-8: Recommendation Match, TTL, Operator ID, Replay Guard"]
        POL --> R9["Rules 9-10: Idempotency & Concurrency Mutex Lock"]
        POL --> R11["Rules 11-13: Rollback Handler, Net Benefit, Warnings Ack"]
        POL --> R14["Rules 14-15: Remediation Budget & Max Blast Radius"]
    end

    Policies -->|Any Violation| BLOCK[Execution Blocked & Logged]

    Policies -->|All 15 Rules Satisfied| LOCK[Acquire Service Lock<br/>Exclusive Mutex on Target Service]
    LOCK --> SNAP[Capture Pre-Execution Snapshot<br/>Replicas, Config, Telemetry]
    SNAP --> EXEC[Execute Allowlisted Executor<br/>Controlled Service Mutation]

    EXEC --> VERIF{Telemetry Verification Window<br/>Freshness &amp; Latency Gating}

    VERIF -->|Metrics Return to Normal| RES[State: INCIDENT_RESOLVED / RECOVERED<br/>Release Service Mutex Lock]
    VERIF -->|Degraded / Oscillating / Timeout| RB[Trigger Safe Rollback Handler<br/>Restore Pre-Execution Snapshot]

    RB --> RB_VERIF{Rollback Verification Gate}
    RB_VERIF -->|Rollback Succeeded| RB_OK[State: ROLLBACK_COMPLETE<br/>Budget Decremented]
    RB_VERIF -->|Rollback Failed / Double Fault| ESC[State: MANUAL_INTERVENTION<br/>Trigger High-Priority Pager]

    RES --> JRN[(Append-Only Journal<br/>orchestration_journal.jsonl)]
    RB_OK --> JRN
    ESC --> JRN
    BLOCK --> JRN
    CANC --> JRN

    classDef pass fill:#064e3b,stroke:#10b981,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc;
    classDef fail fill:#7f1d1d,stroke:#ef4444,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc;
    classDef gate fill:#312e81,stroke:#6366f1,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc;
    classDef state fill:#1e293b,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc;

    class RES,RB_OK pass;
    class BLOCK,ESC,CANC fail;
    class APP,POL,VERIF,RB_VERIF gate;
    class LOCK,SNAP,EXEC,RB state;
